			<dict>
				<key>UUID</key>
				<string>C9976256-E0AF-5447-9D62-8530D1B5519C</string>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Background Notes MCP bridge v3. Explicit Text inputs and serialized text tokens for native text parameters; explicit WFHTML input. Fixed allowlist; exact title and literal body scope checked after unique search. MCP validates IDs, revisions and readback. No UI actions, database writes, shell scripts, network or arbitrary action execution.</string>
